1
00:00:00,545 --> 00:00:02,115
(Sheldon:)I wasn't
making a joke,

2
00:00:02,114 --> 00:00:04,084
(Sheldon:)I was merely
stating fact.

3
00:00:04,082 --> 00:00:07,952
(Sheldon:)Amy and I have a superior
relationship to yours.

4
00:00:07,953 --> 00:00:10,283
(Leonard:)You don't honestly
think that, do you?

5
00:00:10,289 --> 00:00:11,819
Y... Leonard,

6
00:00:11,823 --> 00:00:14,053
(Sheldon:)I assumed you knew.

7
00:00:15,294 --> 00:00:17,094
(Sheldon:)The ranking of
relationships in our circle

8
00:00:17,095 --> 00:00:19,495
by quality is:
me and Amy,

9
00:00:19,498 --> 00:00:22,298
(Scene:)Howard and Bernadette,
Raj and his girlfriend,

10
00:00:22,301 --> 00:00:24,971
(Sheldon:)Penny and Chardonnay,
Penny and you.

11
00:00:27,939 --> 00:00:29,939
LEONARD:
There isn't any ranking.

12
00:00:29,941 --> 00:00:32,811
(Leonard:)And if there were, we wouldn't
be at the bottom of it.

13
00:00:32,811 --> 00:00:35,481
(Penny:)Yeah, and actually,
I drink Sauvignon Blanc.

14
00:00:37,482 --> 00:00:39,482
(Leonard:)That's the part
you have a problem with?

15
00:00:39,484 --> 00:00:41,484
(Penny:)Relax.

16
00:00:41,486 --> 00:00:44,286
AMY: There they go,
fighting again.

17
00:00:44,289 --> 00:00:46,919
(Amy:)You'd never hear her talk
that way to Sauvignon Blanc.

18
00:00:50,529 --> 00:00:52,859
(Raj:)So you never played
baseball as a kid,

19
00:00:52,864 --> 00:00:54,694
(Raj:)not even
Little League?

20
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,870
(Howard:)Well, I was going to,
but the day of tryouts

21
00:00:56,868 --> 00:01:00,018
(Howard:)I found my dad's
Playboy collection.

